'''Ryuichi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by purchasing the 11-draw Capsule at the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[River City Ransom Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 874
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Ryuichi
|name2 = Ryuichi & Ryuji
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ryuichi & Ryuji''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Like the other [[River City Ransom Collaboration Event|River City]] [[Uber Rare Cats]], Ryuichi changes significantly between forms and has a single-slot [[Cat Combo]], but unlike them, he also gains a second one in his Evolved Form. While he does have a Move Speed Up Combo, the low stats and very poor uptime on his [[Weaken]] in Normal Form are generally not worth sacrificing the second Combo for, unless the super-backliner range is absolutely necessary to chip down enemies.

===Evolved Form===
Ryuichi & Ryuji gain much higher HP, slightly higher damage, a faster attack rate but much lower range compared to their Normal form, allowing them to become a wall for other units, and a [[Savage Blow]] making their damage more acceptable for a melee unit, there is a 65.7% chance for them to inflict atleast one Savage Blow per attack cycle, making their average DPS much higher. While the weaken chance is lowered, they also gain [[Multi-Hit]] to compensate, if all three hits connect, there is a 48.8% chance to inflict Weaken once per attack cycle. Their third hit pierces over 300 range from their detection range to  help with potentially weakening and chip enemies far in the backline. They also gain an extra [[Cat Combo]] to increase starting money, which along with their Move Speed Up Combo and their own high movespeed, low cost and low cooldown (the low cooldown making them come back faster and gain value) which fits well into a [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher]] play-style, even if the unit itself is mediocre.

{{Job|Classification = Super-Backliner & Crowd-Controller & Combo Slave|EvolvedClass = Melee & Crowd-Controller & Combo Slave|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

